  "worked_solution": "The area of the sector is $S=\\frac{\\theta }{2}{r}^{2}.$ Let's find the differential:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}S(r,\\theta ) & =(\\frac{\u2202S}{\u2202r})\\,\\text{d}r+(\\frac{\u2202S}{\u2202\\theta })\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =r\\theta \\,\\text{d}r+\\frac{{r}^{2}}{2}\\,\\text{d}\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $r=4$ and $\\theta =\\frac{\\pi }{8},$ the differential is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}S(4,\\frac{\\pi }{8}) & =4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{8}\\,\\text{d}r+\\frac{{4}^{2}}{2}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\,\\text{d}r+8\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
